  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Some reactions of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;relevant to photochemical smog formation are</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/890babc6-ffa7-4d2d-ae8b-a1b7f8cc1900-9895196.PNG\" style=\"width: 279px; height: 140px;\" /></p><p>Identify <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
